<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Peerless prices at $11/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Peerless prices at $11/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	     Peerless Systems Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				    $11.00</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			 3,750,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	 Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC</p>
<p>Note: The company said that 2,500,000 shares are being sold by the company, 1,073,978 shares are being sold by the selling securityholders and 176,022 shares are being sold by the underwriters.</p>
<p>Note: The company and the Selling Securityholders also granted the underwriters an option to purchase up to an aggregate of 562,500 additional shares of its common stock to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>Peerless intends to use the net proceeds from the sale for the repayment of indebtedness and equipment lease lines, working capital and general corporate purposes, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
